From 681c54a1bf84ad769c9e2854ca0f2794cc715f7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivan Karpan <ivan.karpan@onereach.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:52:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] activation: Yield from the foreground Steam frontend before
 launch

Detached Wine games can set Win32 focus while native Steam remains active. Ask the active Steam client or UI helper to yield activation to the game bundle and acknowledge that handoff before spawning the compatibility tool. An inactive frontend declines; missing replies have a bounded wait and expired requests cannot yield later.

Keep window levels and Wine process lifetime unchanged. Retain native baseline, delayed-window, blocked-callback, timeout and deliberate-switch controls plus app-ID extraction checks.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
